{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the underground arena, where chaos meets competition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on a mission, dig through destructible caves packed with minerals, power-ups, and rival moles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources, outsmart your opponents, and deposit your minerals in this fast-paced party brawler for 2\u20138 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, blast, and jetpack your way through frantic matches as you race to fill the cart\u2014but watch out, rivals will do anything to steal your haul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig &amp; Destroy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunnel through dynamic, randomly generated maps where no two matches are the same. Shape the battlefield as you dig, fight, and sabotage your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.poster.avif?t=1757570503\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.webm?t=1757570503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.mp4?t=1757570503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Loadout, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match unique tools, gadgets. Master your favorite combo or counter your friends' strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/6d86a580c30e43a431bfaf3fde127d38.poster.avif?t=1757570503\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/6d86a580c30e43a431bfaf3fde127d38.webm?t=1757570503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/6d86a580c30e43a431bfaf3fde127d38.mp4?t=1757570503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaotic PvP Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle up to seven other moles in free-for-all or team-based brawls online. Outplay, out-smart, and out-mine your rivals in unpredictable underground arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.poster.avif?t=1757570503\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.webm?t=1757570503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.mp4?t=1757570503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Party Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and jump into fast-paced online matches with friends, bots or strangers. Mineral Madness supports full controller setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.poster.avif?t=1757570503\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.webm?t=1757570503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.